comment.narrative:
As per Semi-annual report till June 30,  gender specialist appointed via Proceedings No. Rc.No. MAU61-OPES0APPT/7/2024-HR-Part (4), dated 19-01-2025;
Citizen advisory committee reconstituted per Proceedings Rc. No. CRDA-15023(33)/12/2017, dated 27-03-2025; first meeting held on 04.04.2025; second scheduled for 04.07.2025
66 Gender Committee meetings held in June (Q2) with 430 women participants; 66 VO meetings with 2072 women;
8 RWAs formed; 50% women in the general body, 43% in committees; and
GRM active via Parish Karam portal and PGRS; 1179 grievances received, 1186 resolved from Jan 1-June 30,2025 (As per Semi-annual safeguards monitoring report)
